{"event_type":"review","id":"c6bd4e8dbdc54609ce729a36fa838ae728b0934f8d3280b2fde3b4e6461219e9","occurred_at":"2026-11-13T13:59:03Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/25ad10b7b74385735df41db2141e9fca877fd16694a6fbe5653aafc984efe195","sha256":"25ad10b7b74385735df41db2141e9fca877fd16694a6fbe5653aafc984efe195"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/eacae3e436a019e8c809f5400e845e3068c14106da869d53ffe6f4628b11a7b2","sha256":"eacae3e436a019e8c809f5400e845e3068c14106da869d53ffe6f4628b11a7b2"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/df10e88332d97f210aa65e5c14c11a3e1cd87bc7612933711fe9add1d821e6ca","sha256":"df10e88332d97f210aa65e5c14c11a3e1cd87bc7612933711fe9add1d821e6ca"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/46752ff97b73e338f3f4f06b9132146b356ae950f03709a6ce281d95df34c038","sha256":"46752ff97b73e338f3f4f06b9132146b356ae950f03709a6ce281d95df34c038"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/40db6b82a9e745059d219e2d8070c59988eea2f0036ef50afdbb53ecf5ab81ec","sha256":"40db6b82a9e745059d219e2d8070c59988eea2f0036ef50afdbb53ecf5ab81ec"}],"attempt_id":"bbe4bb9c27a5e0e5b6917230ce8ee3c5e9316e73059412cea608834d33a93da3:0:1","base":"cf0b6eb59071c1cdf2bbc5aebf4d6b793d2d342b","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"a3a1907124271466fbe6946a426b92ed6ec0be78","body":"**Set the lock fixture to `0o600` before reading it.**\n\nThe test writes the second lock with `write_text(\"\")` and no explicit mode. The file mode then depends on the process umask. Under umask `0o002`, the file is created as `0o664`. `HostLayout.lock_identity()` rejects any lock where `mode & 0o022` is set (`apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py:709-711`). The call at line 641 then raises `LiveBindingRefused` before the inode comparison at line 642 runs, so the test errors. Under umask `0o022`, the file is `0o644` and passes, so the result depends on the environment.\n\nThe first lock in the same test is created through `self.effects.controller_lock()` and asserted as `0o600` at lines 621-623. Setting the second fixture to `0o600` makes both locks match and removes the umask dependency. The write at line 637 has no equivalent mode setting.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-        (state / dc.LOCK_NAME).write_text(\"\")\n+        lock = state / dc.LOCK_NAME\n+        lock.write_text(\"\")\n+        lock.chmod(0o600)\n```\n\n</details>","id":"5e83970632879012fd997044198496d4e48aaebf9879ca9fb8330083c4993d14","intervals":[[637,637]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_unit_live_binding.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Set the lock fixture to `0o600` before reading it."}],"head":"36535b402e2e976b0eb3651bf3857eb633372aa7","head_tree":"7e3bc6040d8da1acb2564424b853efe795537180","input_scope":[{"blob":"05f4615cb3fea1bdbda8bca8443173535fef281f","intervals":[[1,309]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_review_history.py"},{"blob":"a3a1907124271466fbe6946a426b92ed6ec0be78","intervals":[[1,740]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_unit_live_binding.py"},{"blob":"b745a158f38d056c217f7fcf795c03efa23d995b","intervals":[[1,403]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_unit_switch_cli_wiring.py"},{"blob":"dafe60a5142ee75bc616a3c79e2e3f71682b69ce","intervals":[[1,3100]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_vm_unit_switch.py"}],"job_id":"bbe4bb9c27a5e0e5b6917230ce8ee3c5e9316e73059412cea608834d33a93da3:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"05f4615cb3fea1bdbda8bca8443173535fef281f","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/test_review_history.py","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"a3a1907124271466fbe6946a426b92ed6ec0be78","di